      "note": "Total HOA: Cresswind Palm Beach Association fee $288/mo + Westlake Master Association fee $47/mo. Cresswind fee covers access-control gate entry, community landscaping/irrigation, clubhouse & recreation center, home lawn care/irrigation, and high-speed internet. As of article writing (published Dec 2021, updated Feb 2025). Exact current figures not publicly confirmed elsewhere in this range of sources; other sources report up to $425/mo on recent listings. No CDD special assessment found in public sources checked. Management: older references to Lang Management; current manager unconfirmed. Sales center: 5287 Siesta Key Lane, Westlake FL 33470, (561) 476-0051. HOA entity mailing address: 5615 Saint Armands Way, Loxahatchee FL 33470-2209. Gated 55+ community, Kolter Homes, ~800 homes on 270 acres. Homes 1,434-2,776 sq ft, 2-5 bed, 10 floorplans; starting prices reported from high-$300ks (2021) to $556,990-$588,990 (2025-26 listings). Pet-friendly (dog park on site). Westlake ER (Wellington Regional Medical Center, opened 2019, 24/7) is inside the master community. Unincorporated-area tax advantage cited: ~$1,200-$1,500/yr savings on a $600K home vs Boynton/Delray. Beach 25-35 min east; Turnpike access 5 min; I-95 15 min. Resale history limited (new community). Price range within community reported $400K-$2M (nova55living, unverified). Town Center with Publix/retail still under development per nova55living (unverified)."
